            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The two types of storage hydropower stations (pure storage and pump storage) are combined in the dataset as it is difficult to separate the different types. The data set is based on the storage hydropower stations in the alpine regions of Europe and other specific data. The lifetime is assumed to be 150 years for the dams and 80 years for the rest of the materials. The data set describes a mix and is therefore not representative for individual plants. This dataset recalculated based on Frischknecht et al. (1996) and Bauer (2007), complemented with data from Vattenfall (2008).;
UUID: 9fcd0e0c-a327-3b42-880e-36f4258400b2</common:generalComment>
