        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Mix of reservoir hydropower plants built between 1945 and 1970, therefore the data is not representative for more modern or individual reservoir hydropower stations. Capacity: 95MW\n\n# Included processes\nThe dataset includes the most important materials used for the construction of an average hydropower reservoir in the non-alpine regions of Europe and its disposal/recycling. Furthermore, transports and energy used for the construction as well as particle emissions due to the construction activities are included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
